{%- comment -%}
  Free-shipping nudge (Junid, 21 Nov 2026): free shipping starts at R2,000 (R99 below). When the cart is between
  R1,500 and R2,000 it says how much more makes delivery free. Rendered inside the cart drawer footer and the cart page
  totals, which the theme re-renders on every cart change, so the amount follows the cart. Cents, like cart.total_price.
  The two live files (not kept in this repo subset) carry {%- render 'free-shipping-nudge' -%} just above
  <div class="totals">: snippets/cart-drawer.liquid (inside .cart-drawer__footer) and sections/main-cart-footer.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign free_from_cents = 200000 -%}
{%- assign nudge_from_cents = 150000 -%}
{%- if cart.total_price >= nudge_from_cents and cart.total_price < free_from_cents -%}
  {%- assign gap = free_from_cents | minus: cart.total_price -%}
  <p class="free-shipping-nudge" role="status">Add {{ gap | money_without_trailing_zeros }} more for free shipping.</p>
  <style>
    .free-shipping-nudge { margin: 0 0 1rem; padding: .8rem 1rem; border-radius: .6rem; font-size: 1.4rem; line-height: 1.4;
      background: rgba(var(--color-foreground, 18 18 18), .06); text-align: center; }
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
